IPolicyMethodTest
├── when the selectors are derived
│   └── it should match each function's canonical signature
├── when the verify selector is computed
│   └── it should equal the magic value 0x024ad318
├── when the compiled abi is read
│   └── it should list exactly the specified functions events and errors
├── when verify is read from the abi
│   └── it should declare the specified parameters returns and mutability
├── when trustedParties is read from the abi
│   └── it should declare the specified parameters returns and mutability
├── when supportsInterface is read from the abi
│   └── it should declare the specified parameters returns and mutability
├── when name is read from the abi
│   └── it should declare the specified parameters returns and mutability
└── when version is read from the abi
    └── it should declare the specified parameters returns and mutability
